            "review_title": "Review at Chinh Thuỷ Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Helph M Honorat\nTokyo, Japan1575 contributions\n0\nSeafood in Hanoi!\nMay 2025 • Friends\nChinh Thủy is a well-known seafood restaurant in Hanoi, with big rooms perfect for celebrations or group dinners. The flavors are authentically Vietnamese, and they offer a great selection of fresh seafood. If you’re looking to enjoy quality seafood in Hanoi, this is definitely the place to go.\nWritten June 26, 2025",
